lease speak with the dietitian, chef, or food service manager on duty.\r\n\r\nConsumer Advisory: *Consuming raw or undercooked meats, poultry, seafood, shellfish, or eggs may increase your risk of foodborne illness. \r\n*A message from the N.C. Department of Environment and Natural Resources &amp; Division of Environmental Health.</small>\n\n</div>\n</div>"}